ract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cd2ac383-dd07-4bbe-9453-2dffd8bdbac1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"书中学 -> 预训练"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"654e411e-bb8f-446f-8964-5fa4ee91b75e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"30bcc2d7-966d-4ee9-bf2f-8196c1996c14","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"高人聊 -> 后训练"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"8076d2fb-99ad-43ba-b48e-e8d2deafa1fc","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6a21e158-f923-4b2c-a1fc-3237420d7cef","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"事上练 -> 强化训练"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4a53db16-36dd-4fcb-8053-56451a87dd07","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由此我想到大模型的推理，特别是思考模式，它会在输出正式回答之前进行一次思考输出，然后才输出正式回答，添加这么思考的一个过程居然能把正确性提高非常多（在出现思考模式之前，人们会通过 Prompt 让模型一步一步来进行输出，CoT）。我突然意识到这个先思考的过程和写作的效果是一样的，在写作之前我脑中的思路是没有条理的，甚至有些理解还存在一些问题，但是在写作的过程中，经过不断的思考和调整，思路会变得清晰，对写作内容的理解也会更加深刻，添加写作这个过程同大模型添加思考的过程一样，对后续的输出具有极大的提升，这也证实了我的一个理念，"},{"type":"content-link","contentId":30,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","refId":33,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"a272a59f-66a6-4362-a858-5c6b0d899523","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"写作即思考"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，并同时也表明了写作之重要性及必要性。"}]}],"tags":["随笔","学习方法"],"createTime":1756004061919,"updateTime":1759033659707,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1759033659707},"links":{"card:33":{"key":"card:33","type":"card","id":33}}}